<div id="cookies" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span style="color: #7f7f7f;"><span style="color: #595959;"><span style="color: #595959;"><span style="color: #595959;"><span id="control" style="color: #000000;"><strong><span data-custom-class="heading_1">4. DO WE USE COOKIES AND OTHER TRACKING TECHNOLOGIES?</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></div>
